  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5701.12 \"National Crime Prevention and Privacy Compact\" means the National Crime Prevention and Privacy Compact pursuant to 42 U.S.C. sections 14611 - 14616, as it existed on January 1, 2002.\n\nSource. #8173, eff 9-21-04, EXPIRED: 9-21-12\n\nNew. #10208, eff 10-22-12; ss by #12132, eff 3-17-17 (from Saf-C 5701.111)",
